- [ ] Landing copy (hero, hub, audience, FAQ) is concise ASD-STE100 (short sentences, active voice, `you`)
- [ ] Smoke `/agents/{slug}`, docs page, footer **Autonomous Agent Integrations** link to `/agents/{slug}`

